(7652912, 1245261, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wendy... this is so SO amazing!  How you pulled this off in minimal editing blows my mind.  There was no WAY this could have finished with anything but the blue ribbon!  Oh and PS... the other photo that I had commented should win the blue ribbon before I saw this one....  it is the very one that won red  :)   I feel very proud to celebrate a yellow ribbon next to the two of you!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wendy... this is so SO amazing!  How you pulled this off in minimal editing blows my mind.  There was no WAY this could have finished with anything but the blue ribbon!  Oh and PS... the other photo that I had commented should win the blue ribbon before I saw this one....  it is the very one that won red  :)   I feel very proud to celebrate a yellow ribbon next to the two of you! ', '2020-02-07 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652913, 1245381, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this SO MUCH!  It is AMAZING!  So, it''s true.  The minute I saw this, I was sure it deserved the blue ribbon.  But then several photos later, I saw Wendy''s and knew her bluebird and the teacup would likely bump you to red.  Nevertheless... both images are truly fabulous... and with no editing!  They''re CRAZY good!  Congratulations!  I feel very proud to take the 3rd place spot next to yours and Wendy''s  :)</td>', 'I love this SO MUCH!  It is AMAZING!  So, it''s true.  The minute I saw this, I was sure it deserved the blue ribbon.  But then several photos later, I saw Wendy''s and knew her bluebird and the teacup would likely bump you to red.  Nevertheless... both images are truly fabulous... and with no editing!  They''re CRAZY good!  Congratulations!  I feel very proud to take the 3rd place spot next to yours and Wendy''s  :)', '2020-02-07 00:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
