(7652929, 1245390, 16912, '<td valign="top">I really like this Irene.<br/> <br/>Not sure what is worse, coming 6th and off the front page or fourth and missing a ribbon? According to <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24454" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SandyP</a> however, you were in 4th and 6th lol</td>', 'I really like this Irene. Not sure what is worse, coming 6th and off the front page or fourth and missing a ribbon? According to  SandyP however, you were in 4th and 6th lol', '2020-02-07 05:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
