(7652948, 1245413, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised the "artsy" crowd wasn''t all over this.  No comments?!  Hmmm.  Well, for what it''s worth, I had this picked near the top and was one of the 8''s that were cast for this.  The image is very pleasing to the eye without having a "subject" so to speak.  Can definitely see this hanging on a wall.  Well done!</td>', 'I''m surprised the "artsy" crowd wasn''t all over this.  No comments?!  Hmmm.  Well, for what it''s worth, I had this picked near the top and was one of the 8''s that were cast for this.  The image is very pleasing to the eye without having a "subject" so to speak.  Can definitely see this hanging on a wall.  Well done!', '2020-02-07 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
