(7652956, 1245385, 30049, '<td valign="top">Overall I liked this (gave it a 6).  <br/> <br/>The biggest distraction for me is it feels like I want to reach out and tilt everything back to the right to straighten it out.  Contrast is a little light, but kind of adds to the overall feel of the image.  <br/> <br/>The subject matter was definitely blue and the berries are well focused, etc. - no complaints there.  :-)</td>', 'Overall I liked this (gave it a 6).   The biggest distraction for me is it feels like I want to reach out and tilt everything back to the right to straighten it out.  Contrast is a little light, but kind of adds to the overall feel of the image.   The subject matter was definitely blue and the berries are well focused, etc. - no complaints there.  :-)', '2020-02-07 14:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652957, 1244975, 30049, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a fun find!  Tough to do in trying to isolate this figure a little more - that''s the downside for me on this image, given the challenge - just a bit too much clutter / distraction in the background.  Just one guys opinion.</td>', 'I thought this was a fun find!  Tough to do in trying to isolate this figure a little more - that''s the downside for me on this image, given the challenge - just a bit too much clutter / distraction in the background.  Just one guys opinion.', '2020-02-07 14:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652958, 1245420, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge in a environmental journalist way.  Sad state of affairs isn''t it that all this trash is out there (and this is but a molecule in the vast bucket of crud polluting global waters).</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge in a environmental journalist way.  Sad state of affairs isn''t it that all this trash is out there (and this is but a molecule in the vast bucket of crud polluting global waters).', '2020-02-07 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652959, 1245160, 30049, '<td valign="top">I find the thumbnail of this image to be quite interesting.  It''s so abstract at that size and really made wonder when I first saw it.  When viewed up close the shadows lose their elusiveness / abstract addition to the photo.  While not dismissing the image on a grand scale, I still find it "ok" in full view - just not an "ah-ha!" moment.</td>', 'I find the thumbnail of this image to be quite interesting.  It''s so abstract at that size and really made wonder when I first saw it.  When viewed up close the shadows lose their elusiveness / abstract addition to the photo.  While not dismissing the image on a grand scale, I still find it "ok" in full view - just not an "ah-ha!" moment.', '2020-02-07 14:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
